<title>UK: London gold fixes firmer, targets $325.00.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes firmer, targets $325.00.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $324.20 vs $323.45 AM. Firmer on fund short covering and profit-taking. Some follow-through buying. Resistance likely around current price.</p>
<p>SILVER - Holding firmer levels at $4.27/$4.29 up nine cents. Some short covering.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Steady at $405.50/$408.50 up $4.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Firmer at $180.00/$183.00 up $5.00.</p>
</text>
